        },
        {
          "text": " Kityo ekiragiro ky'omugabe ku kiraarangwe omu bugabe bwe bwona, nk'oku bwingana, abakazi boona nibaija kutiina baibabo, ab'ekitiinisa n'abatakiine. ",
